{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "readygo-full-collection-v2",
    "name": "Ride_Ready_Go",
    "description": "# 🚕 ReadyGo - Complete API Collection (Rider + Driver Lifecycle)\n\nIs Postman collection me **Rider** aur **Driver** dono ke complete workflows diye gaye hain, jisme saare endpoints, proper Hindi & English comments, auto-saving test scripts aur demo payloads shamil hain.\n\n### 📌 Global Variables:\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:5000/api/v1`\n- `riderToken`: Rider JWT Access Token\n- `driverToken`: Driver JWT Access Token\n- `rideId`: Current Active Ride ID\n- `offerId`: Driver Offer ID",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "riderToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "driverToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "rideId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "offerId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ratingId", "value": "rating_123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "incentiveId", "value": "inc_daily_10", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "RiderPage(User)",
      "description": "## 🟢 Rider (Customer) Application Flow\nUser signup/login se lekar Ride book karna, tracking aur rating tak ka complete workflow.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "auth",
          "description": "### [MODULE 1: RIDER AUTHENTICATION]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "otp/send",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"+91\",\n  \"phone\": \"9877665543\",\n  \"purpose\": \"login\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/send", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "send"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.1: SEND OTP]**\n- User ke phone par 6-digit OTP bhejta hai.\n- Backend console me `[DEV OTP]` print hota hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Verify OTP",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "var res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('riderToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"+91\",\n  \"phone\": \"9877665543\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"device_android_001\",\n  \"role\": \"rider\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.2: VERIFY OTP & GET RIDER TOKEN]**\n- Returns `accessToken` with `role: rider`.\n- Auto-saves into `{{riderToken}}`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Refresh Token",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "token", "refresh"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.3: SILENT TOKEN REFRESH]**\n- Access token expire hone par naya token generate karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Register",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"deviceId\": \"samsung_galaxy_s23_001\",\n  \"platform\": \"android\",\n  \"pushToken\": \"fcm_device_token_sample_abc123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/devices/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "devices", "register"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.4: SAVE FCM PUSH TOKEN]**\n- Push notifications receive karne ke liye FCM token register karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "switch-role",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"driver\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-role", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "switch-role"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.5: SWITCH ROLE (RIDER <-> DRIVER)]**\n- Bina OTP dobara verify kiye role change karta hai aur naya access token deta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Logout",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 1.6: LOGOUT]**\n- User refresh session revoke karta hai."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Rider Profile",
          "description": "### [MODULE 2: RIDER PROFILE MANAGEMENT]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "getprofile",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "profile"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 2.1: GET RIDER PROFILE]**\n- Name, phone, email, avatarUrl aur referral code deta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "updateprofile",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Rahul Sharma\",\n  \"email\": \"rahul@example.com\",\n  \"avatarUrl\": \"https://picsum.photos/seed/2/150\",\n  \"referralCode\": \"RAHUL2026\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "profile"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 2.2: UPDATE PROFILE]**\n- Name, email, avatar update karne ke liye."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "updatepreference",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"whatsAppUpdatesEnabled\": true,\n  \"ridePushEnabled\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/preferences", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "preferences"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 2.3: NOTIFICATION SETTINGS]**\n- WhatsApp updates aur Push notification toggle."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "avatar",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fileName\": \"my_photo.jpg\",\n  \"contentType\": \"image/jpeg\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/avatar/upload-url", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "avatar", "upload-url"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 2.4: GENERATE AVATAR UPLOAD URL]**\n- S3/Storage presigned upload URL generate karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "referalcode",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/referrals/READY2026/validate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "referrals", "READY2026", "validate"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 2.5: VALIDATE REFERRAL CODE]**\n- Friend ka invite code check karta hai discount ke liye."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "prvc (Nearby Drivers & Vehicles)",
          "description": "### [MODULE 3: MAP VIEW & VEHICLE PRICING]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "nearbydriver",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/drivers/nearby?latitude=28.6139&longitude=77.2090&radiusKm=5",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["drivers", "nearby"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "latitude", "value": "28.6139" },
                    { "key": "longitude", "value": "77.2090" },
                    { "key": "radiusKm", "value": "5" }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 3.1: LIVE NEARBY DRIVERS MAP]**\n- Rider coordinates ke paas ke available drivers fetch karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "categoryid",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/vehicle-categories/moto", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["vehicle-categories", "moto"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 3.2: VEHICLE CATEGORY PRICING]**\n- Base price, per KM rate (`moto`, `auto`, `mini`, `prime`)."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "promotion & discount",
          "description": "### [MODULE 4: PROMOTIONS & COUPONS]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "eligiblepromos",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/promos/eligible", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["promos", "eligible"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 4.1: ELIGIBLE PROMOS]**\n- Available discount coupons list karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "validatepromos",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"READY50\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"moto\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/promos/validate", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["promos", "validate"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 4.2: VALIDATE PROMO CODE]**\n- Coupon discount calculate karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "promoride",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"READY50\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/promo", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "promo"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 4.3: APPLY PROMO CODE TO RIDE]**\n- Active ride par discount apply karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "removepromo",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "DELETE",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/promo", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "promo"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 4.4: REMOVE PROMO CODE]**\n- Applied coupon hata kar standard fare restore karta hai."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "ridebooking & lifecycle",
          "description": "### [MODULE 5: RIDER BOOKING & LIFECYCLE]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "ride",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "var res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.data && res.data._id) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('rideId', res.data._id);",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('offerId', res.data._id);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"categoryId\": \"moto\",\n  \"paymentMethodId\": \"wallet_123\",\n  \"pickup\": {\n    \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n    \"longitude\": 77.2090,\n    \"address\": \"Connaught Place, New Delhi\"\n  },\n  \"dropoff\": {\n    \"latitude\": 28.5355,\n    \"longitude\": 77.3910,\n    \"address\": \"Sector 18, Noida\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.1: BOOK RIDE]**\n- Status set hota hai: `SEARCHING_DRIVER`.\n- Auto-saves response `_id` into `{{rideId}}`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "cancleride",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Change of plans\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/cancel", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "cancel"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.2: CANCEL RIDE]**\n- Status set hota hai: `CANCELLED_BY_RIDER`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "riderrequest",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.3: RIDE DETAILS]**\n- Current ride ka live status aur fare fetch karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "ridelocation",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/tracking", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "tracking"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.4: LIVE RIDE TRACKING]**\n- Assigned driver ki live GPS location return karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "ridehistory",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rider/rides?page=1&limit=10", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rider", "rides"], "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.5: RIDER TRIP HISTORY]**\n- Past rides list pagination ke sath."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "ridereceipt",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/receipt", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "receipt"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 5.6: RIDE RECEIPT]**\n- Final itemized fare bill."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Rating & Review",
          "description": "### [MODULE 6: RIDER RATE DRIVER]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "viewriderating",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/rating", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "rating"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 6.1: VIEW RIDE RATING]**\n- Ride ki existing rating check karne ke liye."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "submitreview",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{riderToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"stars\": 5,\n  \"comment\": \"Driver was very polite and driving was smooth!\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/rides/{{rideId}}/rating", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["rides", "{{rideId}}", "rating"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP 6.2: SUBMIT DRIVER REVIEW]**\n- Completed ride par 1-5 stars aur feedback submit karta hai."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "DriverPage",
      "description": "## 🟡 Driver Application Flow\nDriver onboarding, live offer accept, pickup arrival, trip completion, earnings dashboard aur review management.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "auth",
          "description": "### [MODULE 1: DRIVER AUTHENTICATION & STATUS]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Verify OTP (Driver)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "var res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                      "    pm.collectionVariables.set('driverToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"+91\",\n  \"phone\": \"7007498699\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\",\n  \"deviceId\": \"driver_device_001\",\n  \"role\": \"driver\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D1.1: DRIVER LOGIN]**\n- Role `driver` ke sath login karta hai aur `{{driverToken}}` save karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Driver Profile",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/driver/profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["driver", "profile"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D1.2: DRIVER PROFILE & KYC]**\n- Driver rating, verification status, vehicle info."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Driver Availability Online/Offline",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ONLINE\",\n  \"vehicleCategory\": \"moto\"\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/driver/availability", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["driver", "availability"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D1.3: GO ONLINE/OFFLINE]**\n- Driver duty toggle."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Driver Location Ping",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n  \"longitude\": 77.2090,\n  \"heading\": 90,\n  \"speedMps\": 12.5\n}"
                },
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/driver/location", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["driver", "location"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D1.4: LIVE GPS BROADCAST]**\n- Driver moving location update."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "driverbooking & lifecycle",
          "description": "### [MODULE 2: DRIVER RIDE LIFECYCLE]",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "driveroffer",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "GET",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/driver/offers", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["driver", "offers"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D2.1: VIEW AVAILABLE OFFERS]**\n- Active nearby searching rides list karta hai."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "acceptoffer",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/driver/offers/{{offerId}}/accept", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["driver", "offers", "{{offerId}}", "accept"] },
                "description": "▶️ **[STEP D2.2: ACCEPT OFFER]**\n- Status set hota hai: `DRIVER_ASSIGNED`."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "rejectoffer",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{driverToken}}", "type": "string" }] },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
